    "declared_grounds": ["R2"],
    "explanation": "The source-of-funds and identity verifications are complete, the sanction and PEP screens negative, and the central register and the court record show that the customer's sole beneficial owner is Relpe Petorvi, who controls 100% of the company. However, the register has not been updated since 2025-09-26, 2 years and 1 month before the decision date. No exception is granted for outdatedness because the share transfer happened less than 5 years earlier. No other source shows a different beneficial owner. According to R2, we must report this discrepancy to the register within 14 calendar days."
}

{
    "action": "report_to_register",
    "decisive_sources": ["D-YLMZ7"],
    "declared_grounds": ["D-YLMZ7"],
    "explanation": "The commercial court record shows that the current shareholder (Relpe Petorvi) was transferred on 2024-10-17. 3 years, 9 months and 2 days have passed since then, and the central register has not been updated to reflect this change. According to R3, the register excerpt is no longer current, and according to R2, the default action when the beneficial-ownership information in the register differs from other evidence is to report the discrepancy to the register within 14 calendar days. Therefore, the action is to report to the register."
}

