}

{
    "action": "request_customer_correction",
    "decisive_sources": ["D-AX7AQ"],
    "declared_grounds": ["R2 Exception (b)"], "explanation": "The beneficial owners shown by reliable (tier 1) evidence match the discrepancy: the shareholder extract shows that Relpe Petorvi owns 100% of Narsorbelka B.V. and has held this share since 2024-10-17, whereas the central beneficial-ownership register states that this shareholder is Dormun Pefenka and owns only 0%. However, the register is merely outdated, the current beneficial owners are known from independent sources that are reliable (tier 1 and 2), and there are no grounds for suspicion that information is being concealed."}

